"लाइसेंसिंग\", टिप्पणी 2 व 3 में प्रस्तावित):** "

#: ../../book/comparison.rst:97
msgid ""
"**When applicable:** Once the revised catalogue takes effect, open-sourcing "
"restricted AI technology, deploying models on a **Chinese firm's self-built,"
" self-operated overseas compute center**, sending chip blueprints abroad for"
" **foundry tape-out** (``芯片流片``), conducting joint international R&D or "
"standards work, and exporting restricted biomedical targets for out-"
"licensing or humanitarian relief `CN-A1, notes 2 and 3 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_."
msgstr ""
" **कब लागू है:**  संशोधित सूची प्रभावी होने के बाद, नियंत्रित एआई तकनीक को "
"ओपन-सोर्स करने,  **चीनी कंपनी के स्व-निर्मित व स्व-संचालित विदेशी कंप्यूट "
"केंद्र**  पर मॉडल तैनात करने,  **फ़ाउंड्री टेप-आउट**  (``芯片流片``) के लिए चिप "
"ब्लूप्रिंट विदेश भेजने, संयुक्त अंतरराष्ट्रीय अनुसंधान या मानक-निर्माण करने,"
" तथा आउट-लाइसेंसिंग या मानवीय सहायता हेतु नियंत्रित बायोमेडिकल लक्ष्यों का "
"निर्यात करने के लिए `CN-A1, notes 2 and 3 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_\\"
" ।"

#: ../../book/comparison.rst:98
msgid ""
"**What is specified:** The draft and official explanation propose automatic "
"licensing or similar facilitation. They do not establish a complete final "
"filing procedure or a guaranteed turnaround for that future route. Confirm "
"the implemented procedure with the competent authority. `CN-A1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
